          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.30.010:block:30",
          "start": 6128
        },
        "quote": "“Subdivision” means the division of a parcel of land into two or more lots or parcels for the purpose of transfer of ownership or building development.",
